## 🛠️ Tools Used
- **PostgreSQL** – SQL-based data cleaning
- **Tableau** – Dashboard and visual analytics
- **Pandas** – For quick simulations (optional)
- **VS Code / DBeaver / pgAdmin** – SQL environment

---

## 📌 Key Takeaways

- Cleaned and transformed a raw dataset to be visualization-ready
- Practiced advanced SQL queries (CTEs, JOINs, CASE, COALESCE, SPLIT_PART)
- Built an interactive Tableau dashboard from scratch
- Focused on real-world data wrangling skills for business insights

